# SPA fallback. Static assets take precedence over this on Cloudflare Pages
# (verified against production: /favicon.svg, /assets/*, and the APK all serve
# intact), so it only fires on a miss.
#
# Do NOT try to 404 missing /apk/* here — Pages ignores a 404 status in this
# file (tested against production, it still returned 200). Missing APKs are
# handled instead by keying _headers on the exact filename, so a miss is served
# as honest text/html, plus a router rule sending /apk/* to /download.
/*    /index.html   200
